  `cartodb-on-gcp-datascience.LGARCIADUARTE_CARTO.wfproc_api_1c7177626dadc17f`(
)
BEGIN
  /*
   {"diagramJson":"{\"title\":\"[SDSCNY26] 3. Estimate visitor counts\",\"description\":\"Trains a random forest model on the 13 Erewhon stores and predicts the visits and the 60% trade area of two new stores.\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"7ab4fbdf-f290-4e29-b231-97c7bb4aea9d\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#E5E5E5\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":575.992,\"height\":271.999,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Overview\\n---\\n## Estimate visitor counts for new stores\\n\\nA regression model learns the visits of the 13 current stores from two things: the PlacePulse embedding of each origin cell and its distance to the store. The model then predicts the visits for the new stores in Costa Mesa and Thousand Oaks.\\n\\n- **Train:** fits the model on the current stores.\\n- **Prepare:** builds one row for each cell and new store.\\n- **Predict:** estimates the visits and the trade area of each new store.\",\"position\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-560}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":640,\"height\":464,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-560},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-800}},{\"id\":\"e37db581-6ba5-4b70-9b5a-2c8db38cbf3d\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#F6CF71\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":367.997,\"height\":527.996,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Data\\n---\\n## Inputs\\n- `erewhon_la_stores`: location of the 13 current stores.\\n- `erewhon_visits_by_h3z7_la`: visits from each H3 cell (`h7`) to each current store.\\n- `placepulse_embeddings_la`: one PlacePulse embedding for each H3 cell in LA (`GEOID`).\\n- `erewhon_new_stores`: location of the 2 new stores.\",\"position\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-272.003}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":352,\"height\":432,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":192,\"y\":-272},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":176,\"y\":-304}},{\"id\":\"424cc9fb-3bf5-4bc2-8d9b-97063daccd75\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#9EB9F3\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":943.994,\"height\":815.9979999999999,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Train\\n---\\n## Train the visitor model\\n1. **H3 Center** gets the centre point of each cell. **Join** attaches the embeddings to the visits, and the second **Join** attaches the store location.\\n2. **Create Column** calculates the distance from the cell to the store. A second **Create Column** calculates `log_visits` = LOG(visits + 1), which reduces the effect of cells with very many visits.\\n3. **Drop Columns** and **Generate UUID** keep the model inputs and add a unique `id`.\\n4. **Create Regression Model** trains a random forest regressor that predicts `log_visits`.\",\"position\":{\"x\":784,\"y\":-560.007}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":816,\"height\":336,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":784,\"y\":-560},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":896,\"y\":-640}},{\"id\":\"3c811bd3-f4fd-4727-9f4e-80e1f8709e9c\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#DCB0F2\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":687.995,\"height\":367.998,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Prepare\\n---\\n## Pair each cell with each new store\\n1. **Cross Join** combines every LA cell with each new store.\\n2. **Create Column** calculates the distance from the cell to the new store, and a second **Create Column** makes an `id` from the cell and the store name.\\n3. **Drop Columns** keeps the same inputs that the model used for training.\",\"position\":{\"x\":1008,\"y\":-144}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":688,\"height\":256,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":1008,\"y\":-144},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":1024,\"y\":112}},{\"id\":\"7cbe1b5f-625d-4a3c-8679-1b70bae65556\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#8BE0A4\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":543.9920000000001,\"height\":815.9979999999999,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Predict\\n---\\n## Estimate visits and trade areas\\n1. **Predict** applies the model. **Create Column** converts the prediction back to visits with EXP(prediction) - 1.\\n2. Two **Create Column** steps split the `id` back into `store_name` and `h3`.\\n3. **Top 60%** keeps, for each new store, the cells with the most visits until they hold 60% of its total. It merges these cells into one trade-area polygon.\\n\\n\",\"position\":{\"x\":1744,\"y\":-560}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":576,\"height\":384,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":1744,\"y\":-560},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":1776,\"y\":-640}},{\"id\":\"98dcc9dd-1f85-4eed-b00f-ef84dcdca3f5\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"native.joinv2\",\"type\":\"generic\",\"label\":\"Join\",\"inputs\":[{\"name\":\"lefttable\",\"type\":\"Table\",\"title\":\"Left table\",\"description\":\"Left table\"},{\"name\":\"righttable\",\"type\":\"Table\",\"title\":\"Right table\",\"description\":\"Right table\"},{\"name\":\"lefttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in left table\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in left table\",\"value\":\"h7\"},{\"name\":\"lefttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Left table columns\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Left table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"store_name\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"store_name\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"visits\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"visits\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"h7\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"h7\\\"}]\"},{\"name\":\"righttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in right table\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in right table\",\"value\":\"GEOID\"},{\"name\":\"righttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Right table columns\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Right table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_0\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_0\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_1\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_1\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_2\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_2\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_3\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_3\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_4\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_4\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_5\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_5\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_6\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_6\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_7\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_7\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_8\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_8\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_9\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_9\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_10\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_10\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_11\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_11\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_12\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_12\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_13\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_13\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_14\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_14\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_15\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_15\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_16\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_16\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_17\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_17\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_18\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_18\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_19\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_19\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_20\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_20\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_21\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_21\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_22\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_22\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_23\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_23\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_24\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_24\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_25\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_25\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_26\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_26\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_27\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_27\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_28\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_28\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_29\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_29\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_30\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_30\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_31\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_31\\